# ShopDemo core

- Read `spec-driven/specs/<relevant>/SPEC.md` before implementation.
- Course documentation lives under `docs/` (Spanish). Link to it when explaining.
- Solution file: `ShopDemo.slnx`. Target framework: net10.0.
- Never commit secrets. Use `.env.example` patterns only in repo.
- User communication: Spanish. Identifiers and rules: English.

## Services & ports

| Service | Port (local) |
|---|---|
| Catalog | 8001 |
| Orders | 8002 |
| Inventory | 8003 |
| Analytics | 8004 |
| MCP Gateway | 8005 |

## Architecture

- Catalog/Orders: Clean Architecture + CQRS + MediatR
- Inventory: Hexagonal (ports/adapters)
- Analytics: Aspire ServiceDefaults + Event Hubs consumer
